  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Engineering Design &amp; Construction Supervision of The Northern Corridor New Housing Settlements Upgrading Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this Task Order is to provide urgent A&amp;E construction management services to (1) conduct and inspection of the entire Caracol EKAM project, including civil works and the 750 houses; (2) make A&amp;E recommendations and oversee the completion of remediation of identified and reparable defects in work on the project; and (3) provide support to USAID for the development of related contractual adjustments under the relevant contracts</narrative>
  </description>
